---
/**
 * KodDaVinchiSectionFaq — Рефакторинг 6.0 shadow-breakout section.
 *
 * Promoted from legacy 18-sec-faq.html to hand-authored Astro,
 * preserving the legacy DOM/classes byte-for-byte in rendered shape.
